On available
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, they're none other than Fallen Angels. They're powerful monsters so be careful."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Do you know about an object called the horn of comprehension?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The horn of comprehension is the most precious object to us priests.\n\nA prospective priest who went out training a while ago had lost it to the Fallen Angels on the lowest level of the Abyss Dungeon.  Right now, that prospective priest is going through a period of repentance for his mistake, so we need someone to go there and bring it back.\n\nIf it goes into someone's hand, worse yet into the hand of the enemy, then it could be a big problem for us.  Could youKill the Fallen Angel from the lowest level of the Abyss Dungeon?"

On in_progress
    Say "horn of comprehension can be retrieved from Fallen Angels in the nether Abyss Dungeon."

On ready
    Say "Master, you Kill the Fallen Angel. Hurry back to [Priest] Minerva."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. This completes the  Kill the Fallen Angel in the mainland. May the gods shower you with blessings."
